<deviceset name="WE-PBF_7847" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:14283186/3" prefix="FB">
<description>WE-PBF Flat Wire High Current SMT Ferrite Bead
Wired SMT Ferrite

Characteristics
Flat wire
Suitable for applications with high currents up to 18 A
Glued version: High mechanical stability
Operating temperature: –55 ºC to +125 ºC

Applications
Voltage supply for high load current
Glued version is specially designed for applications with permanent vibrations.

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-PBF

Updated by Ella 2021-08-17
2021 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
